------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software downloads and compiles dictionary data from the Igbo API project:

    Igbo API — https://github.com/nkowaokwu/igbo_api
    Copyright 2023 Nkọwa okwu
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

That data is fetched at runtime from the upstream repository and is NOT
redistributed in this repository. It is compiled locally, unmodified in
content, into a SQLite database for offline lookup.

The Igbo language dictionary content itself — headwords, definitions, example
sentences, and the Nsibidi character set — is the work of Nkọwa okwu and the
Igbo API contributors. Please support that project:

    https://nkowaokwu.com
    https://igboapi.com
